07/08/2026 15:35:24:   anotacao: '> O endereço informado na Receita Federal está divergindo do informado na Cotação Detalhada no campo Logradouro. Todos os documentos onde houver o campo endereço devem constar com a mesma informação. \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*Endereço\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*\n' +
07/08/2026 15:35:24:     '\n' +
07/08/2026 15:35:24:     '> Cliente já é da base e está criando outra Unidade de Contrato incorretamente, pois ele já possui uma estrutura com linhas ativas do mesmo plano na mesma regional das linhas que está contratando agora. Portanto, as linhas devem ser inseridas dentro da estrutura já ativa. \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*Criação de Nova Estrutura Mobile\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\*\n' +
07/08/2026 15:35:24:     '\n' +
07/08/2026 15:35:24:     '> No TCPJ consta que o cliente adquiriu o aparelho com um SIM Card atrelado no valor de R$ 1,00, porém essa informação diverge da cotação, na qual foi contratado o modelo E-CHIP QR CODE.\n' +
07/08/2026 15:35:24:     'É necessário confirmar qual modelo de SIM Card o cliente deseja utilizar. Em casos de compra de aparelho com vinculação a uma tecnologia de SIM Card diferente da informada na cotação, é importante especificar corretamente no pedido para garantir o envio do modelo adequado.\n',
07/08/2026 15:35:24:   status: 'reprovado',
07/08/2026 15:35:24:   auditoria_anotacao: '',
07/08/2026 15:35:24:   auditoria_status: ''
07/08/2026 15:35:24: }
